1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,720
In our house, breakfast was the time we
were all together.

2
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:14,796
One morning, my mom and I started joking
about the things my dad doesn't like.

3
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:22,143
We thought it was funny. He didn't
laugh.

4
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:28,578
Upset, he got up and left the table
before finishing his breakfast.

5
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:34,464
He washed his hands.

6
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:42,804
Then he came back and stood there
quietly, without a word.

7
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:51,964
Then we realised we had made him sad. We
smiled and said sorry.

8
00:00:55,400 --> 00:01:02,160
He laughed, sat back down and started
eating. Then he said:

9
00:01:02,410 --> 00:01:07,925
"I only came back because you said
sorry. I'm only eating for you!"

10
00:01:08,775 --> 00:01:14,550
To this day, we laugh when we remember
it. Sometimes one 'sorry' is enough to

11
00:01:14,590 --> 00:01:17,006
bring someone back to the table.
